  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DanChurchAid - Mine Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s objective is to create a safe basis for impacted communities and the return of displaced persons through clearance of agricultural areas and strengthening of local and national capacities in Mykolaiv and Kherson oblasts. The expected results are to release and handover previously contaminated areas, increase perception of safety within impacted communities and strengthen national mine action capacity through a long-term strategic partnership between DanChurchAid and national mine action partners.</narrative>
  </description>
